{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_47530","headline":"七言 三十九 · 吕岩","name":"七言 三十九","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"倾侧华阳醉再三，骑[龙]遇晚下南岩。\n眉因拍剑留星电，衣爲眠云惹碧岚。\n金液变来成雨露，玉都归去老松杉。\n曾将铁镜照神鬼，霹雳搜寻火满潭。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"吕岩","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_47530.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_47530","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"杂言古诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}